{"reviews":[{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-0","r":5.0,"t":"I love them!","x":"The photo doesn't do these rings Justice. I love them!","h":12,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-1","r":3.0,"t":"You get what you pay for","x":"While a good value set if you don't want to spend too much on nail polish, want to give it away as a gift or buy it as a starter set, the quality of the polishes aren't that great.  The pastel and neon colours are very sheer, even with 2 coats.  You will need to apply a white polish underneath them in order to make them more opaque.  The glitter colours are so-so.  The metallic colours are the best in my opinion - the shades available are good and are nice and opaque.  The biggest gripe I have a","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-2","r":4.0,"t":"Some colors chip and peel. Great value. Nice set.","x":"Some chip. Some peel. Most are great though. I really love the variety of colors. They are cheap so you can't expect high end quality. Some are a little too sticky. All of the nudes worked great though. No chipping and I wore them for a week. I'm also pretty tough on my nails. Very pleased with the product.","h":5,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-3","r":5.0,"t":"Amazing worth the money","x":"These are amazing \u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f\u2665\ufe0f I\u2019m so impressed I love them so much thank you wow","h":3,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-4","r":5.0,"t":"Nice","x":"So far so good ! Great colors and nice pkg. We have used a few of the, and the colors are bright and stay on very well. We did have to use acetone to remove the sparkle one, but no big deal. The regular nail polish remover did not do the trick.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-5","r":5.0,"t":"Five Stars","x":"great service! really nice selection of colors! I am sure that my grand daughter will be very pleased.","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-6","r":1.0,"t":"One Star","x":"Waste of money. Very very streaky and did not come out nice at all. Buy another brand!!","h":2,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-7","r":5.0,"t":"Company made it right","x":"Excellent company! Although 2 of the bottles arrived broken. My daughter's  nails chipped in about 12 hours.. The polish on my toenails has stayed on for 3 days so far. Some colors are almost identical,  but Not bad for the price. SXC cosmetics shipped out a whole new set of polish, they definitely stand by their products and I wouldn't hesitate to purchase from them again.  My toenail polish has been on for 2 weeks and no chips!  This polish works great for nail stamp art..","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jun 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-8","r":3.0,"t":"Meh....","x":"Beautiful colors, however, most of them take multiple coats to get the full color and it takes FOREVER to dry in between coats.  Shipping was pretty quick and everything came in tact. I will use them occasionally when I have a good 2 to 3 hours for them to fully dry.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2019"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-9","r":5.0,"t":"Excellent","x":"These polishes are excellent for the price. The only polish that doesn\u2019t work is yellow. But the other 23 are great. These dry fast, so work quickly. I use these daily st my salon with no complaints.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jan 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-10","r":4.0,"t":"Really good polish","x":"I really like the quality of this polish. It dries fast and stays on well. No so thrilled about the colors in the set, but it's exactly as shown so that's on me. It's still good polish.","h":1,"v":0,"d":"Jun 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-11","r":1.0,"t":"This nail polish was a waste of money","x":"This nail polish was a waste of money. It clumped up and dried before I was done painting one nail on my child. Then it chipped and peeled right off that night or the next day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Nov 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-12","r":5.0,"t":"Great value for the price","x":"Great value for the price.  I used them for gifts during Teacher's Appreciation Week.  Fun watching staff go through all the colors trying to pick their favorite.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-13","r":4.0,"t":"A great collection of colors.","x":"Beautiful colors. Got one duplicate so took off a star but other than that, lots of colors, glitter, metallic, neon and pastels.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Sep 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-14","r":5.0,"t":"Great colors. Great quality. Great price.","x":"These colors are beautiful and vibrant. The quality is definitely a lot better than I expected!","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-15","r":1.0,"t":"Not worth the money","x":"Its is reasonably priced, but the polish quality is pathetic. Polish comes out in string.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Dec 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-16","r":5.0,"t":"Love the colors","x":"Love the colors and the wear has been great.  Can't beat the price","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2017"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-17","r":3.0,"t":"Ok","x":"Doesn't last long. Chipped out same day.","h":1,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-18","r":4.0,"t":"So far it looks pretty nice","x":"Wife looked over them last night, seems appropriately excited? Will update if i remember later.  Delivery was crazy quick though, even using the \"no rush\" option so that's a plus.  Nothing was broken (seen that a few times in various reviews, seriously there are so many broken bottle reviews out here) and no repeated colors looks like (again you guys have no idea how many reviews i went through looking for this stuff.  nail polish is hard.)  Again she seems tickled, and I will certainly know mor","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Feb 2019"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-19","r":4.0,"t":"Good for the money","x":"Purchased as a gift for 13 year old daughter and she uses them frequently. Polish tends to stay even longer with a good top coat or gel coat. We noticed a lot of the polish are metallic base with a combo of matte or regular polish which is nice.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Aug 2019"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-20","r":5.0,"t":"Great value.","x":"I really like the colors included. Very nice for the price. I use the polish on artificial nails and change weekly so I don't know how well it stays on. I found out if I use the clear nails I paint the inside and it doesn't get scratched.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2019"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-21","r":4.0,"t":"Good for a first nail polish set but..","x":"I love all the colors in this set however there are some colors that are so thick that it\u2019s difficult to work with. Other colors are perfectly fine.. If used with a good base & top coat, they last about 2 weeks (on my toes)","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Oct 2019"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-22","r":5.0,"t":"Perfect!","x":"Needed to buy bulk to make these little 'brides' for my daughter's bridal shower, and didn't want to spend a fortune. I was pleasantly surprised when they arrived, pretty colors and the polish itself is as expected.","h":0,"v":1,"d":"Jul 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-23","r":3.0,"t":"Not that good....","x":"The set is beautiful itself but the colors it is hard to work with very thin or too thick and does not last at all , plus it chips very fast. Recommend buying Sinful colors, Pure Ice, or another brand instead.","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Mar 2018"},{"id":"B01N3RS4ZZ-24","r":1.0,"t":"Terrible quality","x":"This polish appears to be old and does not apply well at all.  Thought it may be just 1 or 2 bottles, but it isn't.  All of the polish bottles were bad and of course, nonrefundable.  DO NOT BUY!","h":0,"v":0,"d":"Sep 2019"}],"emb":"","summary":{"claims":[{"text":"Many reviewers consider the set a great value for the price, especially given the large variety of colors.","cites":[2,3,8,10,13,15]},{"text":"Several reviewers praise the colors as beautiful, vibrant, and offering a nice selection.","cites":[3,5,6,9,14,15]},{"text":"Some reviewers report quality issues like streaky or sheer polish requiring multiple coats, chipping, peeling, or clumping.","cites":[2,3,7,8,9,12]},{"text":"A few reviewers note the polish dries fast and stays on well.","cites":[5,10,11]},{"text":"Some reviewers mention minor issues like duplicate or near-identical colors and a broken bottle, though at least one praised the company for making it right.","cites":[8,14]}]},"qa":[]}